{
 "id": "inflate",
 "label": "Inflate",
 "category": "Distort",
 "tags": ["3d"],
 "version": 1,
 "blurb": "Blows the shapes in the picture up like balloons: a title or logo by its alpha, or the bright or dark parts of a shot, puff out towards you with round swollen edges, and because the air pushes hardest where there is most room, big shapes swell high while thin strokes stay low and tight. Pinched crinkles run in from the seams, and the skin can be glossy latex, mirror foil that reflects a room, or soft cloth. Key Inflate from 0 to blow the picture up.",
 "params": [
